      "review_summary": "The branch exports `readResponsePrefix`, makes its no-reader response fallback fail closed instead of calling whole-body readers, routes `readResponseBodySnippet` through it, and adds regression tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +4, Tests +150. Total +154 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection gives a high-confidence current-main path: pass a no-reader Response-like object with a large `text()` result to `readResponseBodySnippet`, and it materializes the body before enforcing `maxBytes`.",
